   201→          onClick={() => pokemon.evolution.evolution && onSelectPokemon(pokemon.evolution.evolution)}
   202→        >
   203→          {pokemon.evolution.evolution && (
   204→            <>
   205→              <span className="evolution-name">{pokemon.evolution.evolution}</span>
   206→              <span className="evolution-arrow">→</span>
   207→            </>
   208→          )}
   209→        </button>
   210→      </div>
   211→    </div>
   212→  )}
   213→  ```
   214→- Accept `onSelectPokemon` prop from parent component
   215→
   216→### 8. Update App Component - Pass Pokemon Selection Handler
   217→- Open `app/client/src/App.jsx`
   218→- Update the `PokemonDetail` component call to pass the selection handler:
   219→  ```jsx
   220→  <PokemonDetail
   221→    pokemon={pokemonDetail}
   222→    loading={detailLoading}
   223→    error={detailError}
   224→    onSelectPokemon={handleSelectPokemon}
   225→  />
   226→  ```
   227→
