   419→### 14. Create E2E Tests - Setup Test File
   420→- Create new file `e2e/pokemon-detail-enhancements.spec.js`
   421→- Add Playwright imports and test suite structure
   422→- Add `beforeEach` hook to navigate to the app and search for a Pokemon with comprehensive data (e.g., "bulbasaur" which has evolution chain)
   423→
   424→### 15. Create E2E Tests - Pokedex Number Display
   425→- Add test to verify Pokedex number is displayed next to Pokemon name
   426→- Check that the number is on the right side of the header
   427→- Verify format includes "#" prefix
   428→
   429→### 16. Create E2E Tests - Sprite Image Display and Toggle
   430→- Add test to verify default sprite image is displayed
   431→- Add test to click image and verify it changes to shiny sprite
   432→- Add test to click again and verify it returns to default sprite
   433→- Add test to verify sprite label changes ("Default" vs "Shiny")
   434→- Add test for Pokemon without images showing "No image available" message
